# ENV > FILTER ENV: its three pages; LOOP and the bends; a held note runs it; the volume
# envelope's pages stay; SHAPE is gone
wait 300
tap ENV
turn SELECT -20
wait 100
expect page ENVELOPE
turn SELECT 3
wait 100
expect page DESTINATIONS
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
expect page FILTER ENV
turn K3 -1
wait 200
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
expect page FENV SHAPE
turn K3 1
wait 200
turn K4 -1
wait 200
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
expect page FENV LOOP
turn K1 1
wait 200
key 12 down
wait 600
expect voices 1
shot fenv.png
key 12 up
wait 300
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
expect page STEP ENV
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
expect page LIBRARY
